WEBVTT

00:00:05.287 --> 00:00:07.550
[ Giggling ]Yes, King Bob?
是，鲍比国王

00:00:07.593 --> 00:00:09.421
Oh.
是，鲍比国王

00:00:09.465 --> 00:00:11.206
[ Giggling ]King Bob?
鲍比国王？

00:00:11.249 --> 00:00:13.469
[ Laughing ]King Bob?
鲍比国王？

00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:16.428
Ah, Claire. Mmm, Tiffany.
鲍比国王？

00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:19.562
[ Minionese, Growls ]

00:00:23.348 --> 00:00:25.481
♪ Why don't you all
f-fade away? ♪♪

00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:27.483
Pull!

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:29.833
How dare you!
Aaah!
你好大的胆子！

00:00:31.052 --> 00:00:32.792
[ Muffled Shouting ]

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:35.404
[ Grunts ]

00:00:36.622 --> 00:00:37.928
Scarlet!

00:00:37.972 --> 00:00:40.191
Don't you "Scarlet" me,
别再虚伪了，你们这些叛徒！

00:00:40.235 --> 00:00:41.889
you backstabbing
little traitors!
别再虚伪了，你们这些叛徒！

00:00:41.932 --> 00:00:44.587
Using Herb's invention
to steal my crown?
盗用合比的发明来偷我的皇冠？

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:46.937
Uh--
盗用合比的发明来偷我的皇冠？

00:00:46.981 --> 00:00:49.157
I feel used.
I'm not gonna lie.
说真的，我觉得自己被利用了

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.942
You stole my dream.
你偷了我的梦想！

00:00:51.986 --> 00:00:55.163
I was going to
conquer England someday.
我还以为有一天能统治英国！

00:00:55.206 --> 00:00:57.208
There was going to be
a coronation,
那时候会有加冕仪式
我会被冠为皇后

00:00:57.252 --> 00:00:59.515
and I was going to
be made queen.
那时候会有加冕仪式
我会被冠为皇后

00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:01.821
Every moment was planned.
一切都在计划之中

00:01:01.865 --> 00:01:05.173
I'd wear a dress so sparkly
it glowed.
我会穿一件亮的发光的裙子！

00:01:05.216 --> 00:01:09.307
And everyone
who ever doubted me
would be watching,
那些曾经看轻我的人都会望着我…

00:01:09.351 --> 00:01:12.528
and they would be crying!
而流着惭愧的眼泪！

00:01:12.571 --> 00:01:15.966
I was going to be
the picture of elegance
and class!
我会是高雅大方的象征！

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.882
And you pinheads
screwed it up!
但都被你们这些蠢猪搞杂了！

00:01:18.926 --> 00:01:21.711
No, no, no.
[ Minionese ]

00:01:21.754 --> 00:01:26.020
No, no, no, King Bob.
You cannotjust abdicate
the throne.
不，鲍比国王！您不能禅位！

00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:28.196
Who invited the square?
哪里来的古板人士？

00:01:28.239 --> 00:01:31.634
And you definitely
cannot just give the job
to this woman!
您也不能随意让位给这个女人！

00:01:31.677 --> 00:01:33.244
There are laws.
这是违法的！

00:01:33.288 --> 00:01:36.117
What?
[ Minionese ]

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.728
[ Hysterical Laughing ]

00:01:38.771 --> 00:01:42.210
[ Minionese ]
Scarlet "Popapil"!

00:01:42.253 --> 00:01:44.734
[ Murmuring ]King Bob has officially
changed the law,
鲍比国王刚刚宣告修改条规…

00:01:44.777 --> 00:01:46.605
clearing the way
for Scarlet Overkill...
让女魔头斯嘉丽杀人狂当上女皇！

00:01:46.649 --> 00:01:48.651
to be crowned
queen of England.
让女魔头斯嘉丽杀人狂当上女皇！

00:01:48.694 --> 00:01:51.697
She will be coronated
at London's historic
Westminster Abbey.
加冕仪式将在伦敦
最具历史性的威斯敏斯特教堂举行

00:01:51.741 --> 00:01:53.656
If I wasn't so polite,
我若能实话实说，这个国家完蛋了…

00:01:53.699 --> 00:01:57.399
I'd say this spells
certain doom for the country,
if not the world.
我若能实话实说，这个国家完蛋了…

00:01:57.442 --> 00:02:01.055
But I'm so very polite
that I shall keep my mouth shut.
但我必须客套的半句不提

00:02:01.098 --> 00:02:03.709
But, seriously,
we're all in big trouble.
说真的，大家完蛋了

00:02:03.753 --> 00:02:06.451
[ People Shouting ][ Man ]
Scarlet! Scarlet!
斯嘉丽! 斯嘉丽!

00:02:06.495 --> 00:02:09.063
[ Scarlet ]
I don't have time
to answer any questions.
我没空回答任何问题

00:02:09.106 --> 00:02:14.024
I just want to thank
the Minions for going above
and beyond the call of duty.
我只想感谢小小兵尽责的完成任务

00:02:14.068 --> 00:02:19.725
You are three tiny, golden,
pill-shaped miracle workers,[ Giggling ]
你这三个渺小，金黄色
药丸形状的神奇帮手…

00:02:19.769 --> 00:02:24.034
and you have stolen
not just England,
but my heart.
你们除了偷走英国…

00:02:24.078 --> 00:02:25.993
[ Woman ]
Scarlet, over here.
斯嘉丽，看这里！

00:02:26.036 --> 00:02:28.038
[ Minionese ]

00:02:28.082 --> 00:02:29.474
Pardon me?
什么？

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:33.174
- Eh?
- Wow!
哇！好多小小兵！祝贺你！

00:02:33.217 --> 00:02:36.568
So many.
Good for you.
哇！好多小小兵！祝贺你！

00:02:36.612 --> 00:02:39.702
Well, you'll all get
what you deserve.
你们都如愿以偿

00:02:39.745 --> 00:02:41.878
Serve!
[ Minionese ]
Serve!

00:02:41.921 --> 00:02:44.272
[ Shouting In Minionese ]

00:02:44.315 --> 00:02:48.363
♪♪ [ "[Theme From] The Monkees"
In Minionese ]

00:02:54.978 --> 00:02:56.936
[ Laughing ]

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.026
♪♪ [ Continues ]

00:03:05.858 --> 00:03:09.210
[ Minionese ]
Oh.

00:03:11.516 --> 00:03:13.344
Go ahead. Go ahead.
去吧

00:03:14.693 --> 00:03:16.695
Uh--[ Gasping ]

00:03:16.739 --> 00:03:18.088
[ Minionese ]

00:03:21.787 --> 00:03:24.138
[ Stammering ]

00:03:24.181 --> 00:03:27.315
I don't want you
to take this the wrong way,
but I hate you.
我嘴上是这么说，但我恨死你们

00:03:27.358 --> 00:03:29.752
I thought I could
get over what you did--[ Whimpers ]
我以为能够释怀
却放不下你们的背叛

00:03:29.795 --> 00:03:32.885
but I feel so betrayed.
我以为能够释怀
却放不下你们的背叛

00:03:32.929 --> 00:03:35.105
I think--
Uh, yes, I think...
我想是时候分道扬镳了

00:03:35.149 --> 00:03:37.064
we're gonna
have to break up.
我想是时候分道扬镳了

00:03:37.107 --> 00:03:39.762
And it's not you.
错不在于你

00:03:39.805 --> 00:03:43.331
Oh, wait, hold on. It is you.
It's a hundred percent you!
等等，这百分之白是你造成的！

00:03:43.374 --> 00:03:44.941
[ Gasps ]
N-No, no.

00:03:44.984 --> 00:03:46.812
So get comfortable,
Minions.
试着习惯吧，小小兵

00:03:46.856 --> 00:03:49.337
Get real, real comfortable...
要好好习惯

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:51.687
because this is where
you're going to spend...
因为你们将永远被关在这里

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:56.300
the rest of your worthless
little lives.
因为你们将永远被关在这里

00:03:56.344 --> 00:03:58.259
[ Babbling ]

00:03:58.302 --> 00:04:01.349
All right.
Let's do this!
我们开始吧！

00:04:01.392 --> 00:04:03.220
[ Minionese ]
Herb.

00:04:03.264 --> 00:04:05.266
Who's this handsome
"Herb" fellow?
那位名为“合比”的帅哥是谁？

00:04:05.309 --> 00:04:07.746
No, my name is... Blerb.
不，我叫“怖阁”，地牢之主

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.792
I'm a dungeon master.
不，我叫“怖阁”，地牢之主

00:04:09.835 --> 00:04:12.142
Prepare for torture,
which I do.
准备接受酷刑吧！

00:04:12.186 --> 00:04:13.883
[ Gasping ]

00:04:13.926 --> 00:04:16.233
All right. Are we comfy?
Doesn't matter!
怎样，还可以吗？

00:04:16.277 --> 00:04:18.279
This is torture.
没所谓！这是酷刑！

00:04:18.322 --> 00:04:20.455
[ Screaming ]

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.112
Oh.[ Minionese ]

00:04:25.155 --> 00:04:28.245
Wow.
Harder than I thought.
Next machine.
这比想象中困难，下一项刑具！

00:04:28.289 --> 00:04:33.032
Oh, welcome to Hang Town,
population: you!
欢迎使用吊扣！

00:04:34.947 --> 00:04:36.732
Oh. Ah.
[ Laughing ]

00:04:38.603 --> 00:04:40.301
Whoo-hoo!

00:04:40.344 --> 00:04:42.781
Cut it out!
This is really
unprofessional.
别闹了！这样很不专业！

00:04:42.825 --> 00:04:45.044
No laughing
in the dungeon.
地牢里是不允许有笑声的！

00:04:45.088 --> 00:04:48.831
I wanna see tears,
and I wanna hear screams
or I'm gonna get--
我要泪水与喊叫声…

00:04:48.874 --> 00:04:50.485
Wait.Hey.
等等！

00:04:50.528 --> 00:04:52.487
Ooh!
I've got a groovy idea!
我有个好主意！

00:04:54.184 --> 00:04:56.926
- [ Laughing ]
- Look at this! Aaah.
看这个！

00:04:56.969 --> 00:04:58.884
[ All Laughing ]

00:04:58.928 --> 00:05:00.582
[ Herb ]
Whoo-hoo!

00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:03.411
[ Laughing Loudly ]

00:05:03.454 --> 00:05:06.457
[ Scarlet On Speaker ]
Hello! Will the future king,
Herb Overkill,
嗨！请未来国王，合比杀人狂…

00:05:06.501 --> 00:05:08.981
please come upstairs
to prepare for the coronation?
上楼为加冕仪式做准备

00:05:09.025 --> 00:05:11.593
Well, I hope you learned
your lesson for today.
希望你们今天得到教训

00:05:11.636 --> 00:05:13.943
Sí, sí.
[ Minionese ]
顺便一提，刚才一直都是我，合比！

00:05:13.986 --> 00:05:17.468
And by the way,
it was me, Herb,
the whole time.
顺便一提，刚才一直都是我，合比！

00:05:19.253 --> 00:05:22.081
I don't even know
anyone named Blerb.
我根本不认识什么“怖阁”！

00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:23.779
[ Minionese ][ Whimpers ]

00:05:23.822 --> 00:05:25.389
Oh.

00:05:25.433 --> 00:05:28.175
I am hours away...
再过几小时，我就成为英女皇了！

00:05:28.218 --> 00:05:31.134
from becoming
the queen of England.
再过几小时，我就成为英女皇了！

00:05:31.178 --> 00:05:33.223
I know. It's a gas!
是啊，真令人兴奋！

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:35.138
I will finally
get my crown.Yum.
-我始终得到了皇冠 -对啊

00:05:35.182 --> 00:05:36.661
It's all
I've ever wanted.
这是我梦寐以求的

00:05:36.705 --> 00:05:39.142
I'm going to be
so happy.
我将会很快乐

00:05:39.186 --> 00:05:40.622
[ Laughing ]
但让我问你，法布里斯

00:05:40.665 --> 00:05:43.059
But let me
ask you something,
Fabrice.
但让我问你，法布里斯

00:05:43.102 --> 00:05:46.454
Does thatlook
like this to you?
这两个发型相同吗？

00:05:46.497 --> 00:05:48.369
[ Laughing ]
这两个发型相同吗？

00:05:48.412 --> 00:05:50.371
Mrs. Overkill.
杀人狂太太，图片中的发型
就只是两条曲线！

00:05:50.414 --> 00:05:54.157
The hair in that picture,
it's just two wavy lines.
杀人狂太太，图片中的发型
就只是两条曲线！

00:05:54.201 --> 00:05:56.986
Oh! So, what, now
you're an art critic?
怎么，你现在是艺术评论家?

00:05:57.029 --> 00:05:59.902
I drew that
when I was five years old!
那是我五岁时画的！

00:05:59.945 --> 00:06:01.425
Get out of my sight!
给我滚开！

00:06:01.469 --> 00:06:02.948
[ Screaming ]

00:06:05.168 --> 00:06:06.691
Bye, Fabrice!
再见了，法布里斯！

00:06:06.735 --> 00:06:09.868
I liked him.
He was fun.
我满喜欢他的，他很有趣

00:06:09.912 --> 00:06:11.783
So, what do you think
of the dress?
裙子好看吗？

00:06:11.827 --> 00:06:13.872
Oh, it's so beautiful.
漂亮极了，充满了现代感

00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:15.787
So fashion-forward.
漂亮极了，充满了现代感

00:06:15.831 --> 00:06:18.442
So Valentino.
时尚满分

00:06:18.486 --> 00:06:21.097
Gave it a sweetheart neckline
because of my sweetheart.
我为了甜心你特地加了心形领口

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:25.275
The high collar
and cinched waist reflect
a simpler, more violent time.
高领与收紧的腰身呈现了
简约又不失暴力风格剪裁

00:06:25.319 --> 00:06:28.713
The material
is a blend of taffeta
and high-density body armor.
材质混合了塔夫绸与高密度的防弹衣

00:06:28.757 --> 00:06:31.455
Fully armed and loaded.
全副武装

00:06:31.499 --> 00:06:34.153
And that glow?
That's nuclear.
发光体是核能源

00:06:34.197 --> 00:06:36.765
Nice.
Just one more thing to do.
很好，只剩一件事
就能完美无缺的登场

00:06:36.808 --> 00:06:39.681
Gotta look good
for the public.
[ Groans ]
很好，只剩一件事
就能完美无缺的登场

00:06:39.724 --> 00:06:41.944
Do you mind?My pleasure.
这是我的荣幸

00:06:41.987 --> 00:06:44.947
[ Grunts ]Little tighter, sweetie.
再紧些，亲爱的

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:46.949
Come on. I can take it.
我可以的

00:06:46.992 --> 00:06:48.994
A little tighter.
更紧些

00:06:49.038 --> 00:06:50.909
Tighter.[ Grunting ]
更紧！

00:06:50.953 --> 00:06:53.129
Must have... tiny waist.
一定要有小蛮腰

00:06:54.522 --> 00:06:56.306
Seeing stars.
Seeing stars.
够了，我快晕了！

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.395
[ Gasps ]Losing feeling
in my legs.
腿部已失去知觉，完美！捆紧

00:06:58.439 --> 00:07:00.092
Perfect. Tight.
Tight. Tight.
腿部已失去知觉，完美！捆紧

00:07:00.136 --> 00:07:02.269
[ Sighs,
Speaking Minionese ]
腿部已失去知觉，完美！捆紧

00:07:03.574 --> 00:07:05.489
Huh?

00:07:05.533 --> 00:07:07.578
Ah! Bob! Stuart!

00:07:07.622 --> 00:07:09.145
Eh?[ Minionese ]

00:07:09.188 --> 00:07:11.539
[ Chattering, Grunting ]

00:07:13.845 --> 00:07:15.673
[ Yelping ]

00:07:16.892 --> 00:07:20.461
[ Giggling ]
Oh! Bello.
卡纳比街 大本钟

00:07:20.504 --> 00:07:22.463
Poochie, poochie-coo!
Poochie!
愿上帝保佑英女皇

00:07:22.506 --> 00:07:24.595
Ah? Ah.
愿上帝保佑英女皇

00:07:26.205 --> 00:07:28.295
Ah.
[ Minionese ]

00:07:30.558 --> 00:07:32.124
Huh?

00:07:32.995 --> 00:07:34.910
[ Blows Nose ]
献上抱歉与哀悼

00:07:34.953 --> 00:07:37.434
[ Whispering In Minionese ]
献上抱歉与哀悼

00:07:42.309 --> 00:07:45.137
Eh, Kevin!
[ Minionese ]

